==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*100 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 2.67~20 seconds<sup>80f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[One Horn]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 2.67~6.67 seconds<sup>80f~200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring meatshields alongside [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] and dual [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale]] [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cats]] to deal with the more tanky enemies. The Master A shouldn't be much of a problem if you use your attackers efficiently.

